\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"dayOfWeek\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"Monday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Tuesday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Wednesday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Thursday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Friday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Saturday\\\\\\\"], \\\\\\\"opens\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"09:00\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"closes\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"18:00\\\\\\\"}, \\\\\\\"areaServed\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"Dubai\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Abu Dhabi\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"United Arab Emirates\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Saudi Arabia\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Qatar\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Kuwait\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Bahrain\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Oman\\\\\\\"]}\\\"}}]\\n19:T682,\\u003ch1\\u003eSportPro 4.7mm\\u003c/h1\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eDiscover SportPro 4.7mm LED displays in Dubai. Enhance sports events with vibrant visuals. Contact Brightluxx UAE today for a free quote!\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eStadium-grade perimeter and scoreboard LED.\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eBuilt for live sports: 10,000-nit brightness, impact-resistant face, instant content switching. Perimeter-compatible form factor with integrated padding. Used in FIFA and AFC-standard venues.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003eFAQ\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat is the pixel pitch of the SportPro 4.7mm and how does it affect image clarity?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe SportPro features a 4.7mm pixel pitch, providing sharp and clear images suitable for viewing distances starting from 5 meters. This fine pitch ensures detailed content display, ideal for stadium perimeter and scoreboard applications.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eHow bright is the SportPro 4.7mm and is it suitable for outdoor use in bright sunlight?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eWith an impressive brightness of 10,000 nits, the SportPro 4.7mm delivers vivid visibility even under direct sunlight. Its high brightness makes it perfectly suited for outdoor sports venues with varying lighting conditions.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat kind of impact protection does this LED display offer?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe SportPro includes a soft mask and integrated padding to protect against physical impacts, making it durable enough to withstand the demands of live sports events, including ball strikes and accidental contact.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eCan the SportPro 4.7mm LED display be serviced easily if needed?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eYes, the SportPro is designed with rear access serviceability, allowing technicians to perform maintenance or repairs efficiently without removing the entire unit from the installation frame.\\u003c/p\\u003e18:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$19\\\"}}]\\nf:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"charSet\\\":\\\"utf-8\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"viewport\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\\\"}]]\\nc:null\\n11:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"title\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"SportPro 4.7mm LED Display | Premium Sports Screens Dubai | Brightluxx\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"description\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Discover SportPro 4.7mm LED displays in Dubai. Enhance sports events with vibrant visuals. Contact Brightluxx UAE today for a free quote!\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"2\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"canonical\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-spx470\\\"}]]\\n\"])</script></body></html>","rsc":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:I[31262,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\"],\"PageViewTracker\"]\n3:I[48303,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\"],\"SiteHeader\"]\n4:I[39756,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\"],\"default\"]\n5:I[37457,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\"],\"default\"]\n6:I[22016,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\"],\"\"]\n7:I[52006,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\"],\"FloatingActions\"]\n8:I[81888,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\"],\"CookieConsent\"]\na:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljo